ion -- ssh -> curl -> grep --\nblocked by the tool-name counter). Calibrated on production\nshapes: canonical iterators score high (tail -N vs tail -M: 1.0;\ngit-log paging: ~0.67); same-host different-command investigation\nis borderline (~0.5-0.7); tool-switching investigation ~0.07.\nOne-char tokens (the iterator's changing counter) are dropped\nbefore comparison: the counter is noise, the shape is the signal.\"\n  :type 'float\n  :safe #'iar--unit-float-or-nil-p\n  :group 'iar)\n[t+03:15/60:00 c22/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_x1n6dx6w","function":{"index":0,"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/failure-reduction"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:41:30] census-updates.log\ncensus-window-host-guard-note.org\ncensus-window.log\ndescription.org\nmonitor-probe-and-update-census/\n[t+03:28/60:00 c23/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_qwy1sxrd","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/failure-reduction/census-window.log"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:41:41] 2026-09-14: clean window (real data from sophon host, window 00:00-06:30 UTC)\n[t+03:38/60:00 c24/300]"}]
